{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_04_end","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-4","storyName":"小雪崩","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在令、后的帮助下，望窥得岁的梦魇。此局他再失数子，亲历“未来”岁兽苏醒、吞噬众人的惨痛结局，最终在梦中抹除了执白者的身影，再度将岁杀死。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["矩","望","令","？？？","后","朔","力竭的秉烛人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"animtext","id":10,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>759年</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"animtextclean","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":14,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"右脚......嗯，也差不多磨好了。","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"好不容易重塑了身形，做的第一件事，竟然是替人赴死......","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"该上路了——","id":19},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkmeadow","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#6$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"是你。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#3$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"不对，你是祂，但你又不是祂，你是......嘶......","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"有趣，有趣。","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"往日的仇敌变成你眼前这副四分五裂的模样，过去的追随者也成了一班乌合之众，你感想如何？","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#2$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"谈何仇敌？","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"无非做了个梦，耽搁了未竟之事而已。梦醒前逃得一命，没死在大狩猎的铁蹄之下，梦醒后死在这里，倒也不坏。","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#1$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"但你不该在这里悄无声息地杀死我。你最好让我死在炎国的军队阵前，不然，还会有一班又一班的疯癫狂人打着我的名号送死。","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"那才是我不愿意见到之事。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......活不下去的人自然会揭竿而起，究其原因，未必与你有关。","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我不会杀你。正相反，你不能死。","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#1$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"你不诛我这个“首恶”，反倒要来帮我？倒是有趣。","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"那你想怎么处置那帮自诩的“山海众”？虽说只是一鳞半爪，可老木匠的法术毕竟流传到了他们手里，和我不能说没有情分。","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你走，他们自然会活下来。","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"怎讲？","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"炎国的这支军队要拿的是你，不是他们。而你要走，并不困难。","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"若是真有什么阻碍，我会帮你。","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"至于这支山海众，他们大概还能支撑两日。两天过后，他们会全军覆没，炎国的军队也会折损三成。","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"若是你留在这儿替他们赴死，他们只会更加狂热，死战不退。","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"而你一走，他们会逃，炎国军队也会因达成目的而罢兵。","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你想要止战，唯有此路。","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#4$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"你果然是祂......不，你不完全像祂。在人心筹谋一道，你强过祂十倍。","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"我今天欠了你这么大的恩情，你又想从我这儿得到什么？","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"一手闲棋而已，有用则用，无用也就罢了。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#1$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"呵......你这样讲，反倒让我不甘心了。","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"我答应你，这一份恩情，我将来必定还你。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你不知我要做的事，又如何谈得上帮我？","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#3$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"连巨兽都是你口中的“闲棋”，你所谋算的，必定不在人，而在己。所谓四分五裂，究竟裂成了多少？","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......十二。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4221_ju_1#1$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"最终留下的，到底是“十二”，还是那个“一”，你所关心的，想来也只有这件事了。","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"姑且给阁下一个建议，独木难成林，你想做的事可谓逆天而行，最好多寻助力。","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"你也应当多去问问你那些兄弟姐妹，是否能给出些和你不尽相同的解法。你们这样的存在，本就不可以寻常的道理法度考量。","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"矩","text":"但愿你能寻到一个解法，也算为这世上生灵除去了一桩祸患......","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":76},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"1","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":81},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"只要我的这个梦没有磨损殆尽，只要我的梦里还有我们十二个人，我们就永远不会彻底消失。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"虚则实之，大道逍遥，大抵如是。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我却只听见你想背上一副轭，一副最重的轭。","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你只是把一家人全部拖入了岁兽将醒未醒的那一刻，又把那一刻在你自己清醒的梦里延展为永恒......","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"可你又能迁延多久？","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"把这人间的所有佳酿都喝到尽兴，怎么样？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......我还是希望能有一条不必如此困顿的路。","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"我们和祂本就谈不上对等，若不困顿，又怎么可能在死中求活？","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我懂。可......","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......救矩兽并非我一时兴起。","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"怎么又说起这个？你做事当然有原因，只是你往往看得太远，却忘了近处的......","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"等等，你是说？","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我是受人所托。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"谁？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"后兽。","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"那位老头，竟然也还活着？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"祂没有像山海众那样的拥趸，也因此避开了大炎的监视。我帮祂脱离了大炎可触及的范围之后，祂才告诉我矩兽的事。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"......这件事，告诉大哥了吗？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"未曾。","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"......该乖觉的时候，你倒也挺乖觉的。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我庇护后兽离开炎国地界后，也曾向祂询问破局之法，祂说的一句话的确让我有所启发。","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","focus":"l","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"“我未必在祂梦中，祂未尝不在我梦中。”","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"哈，那个老头子还是这般有趣，有机会的话还真想和祂对饮一回了。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"岁兽最近异常活跃，很有可能，是梦中有什么东西正在惊扰祂，才大大加快了祂醒来的速度。","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"尽管只是治标之策，但我若是能入祂梦中，看清究竟是何物作祟......","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"招招行险，你不怕惊醒祂？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"祂七十年后醒来，还是七天后醒来，于我们而言，真有那么大区别吗？","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"......若是我不帮你？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我会另想办法。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"这办法包不包括和我相关的馊主意，比如，偷到我头上来？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"不说话，看来是默认了？","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"......唉。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"答应我，你不会在梦中轻举妄动。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"要是有违诺言——","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"停。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"家人之间，没必要这么赌咒发誓。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"但也别让我伤心。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"嗯。","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"好了，既然你答应我，那就喝了这盏酒吧。酒盏一并送你。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"只是喝酒就足够了？","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"做梦而已，一盏酒便够了，难道还需要什么仪式不成？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"text","text":"年纪稍长的代理人举起酒盏，一饮而尽。","id":172},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":173},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","id":174},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":178},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_cnclouds","layer":"1","id":179},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_bg_25_g07_fairyland_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","duration":"1","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"头昏目眩，代理人还是强撑着用手臂支起身体。","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"不知何时，肘下的石桌已经变成了一块山石，石上青苔密布。","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"他确信，无论是在那片混沌之中，还是行走人间之后，他都未曾见过这样的风景。","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"他本就是祂，但祂的梦太过繁复，他不可能一一检视。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这里是......","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"charslot","id":193},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act16d5d0/m_sys_act16_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":194,"musicid":1},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dust_01","layer":"2","id":195},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_whitemask","layer":"3","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","id":197},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":198},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_25_g08_pavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"3","id":199},{"type":"text","text":"战场。","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"空无与空无的战场。","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hugemonsterroar","id":202},{"type":"text","text":"代理人听见巨兽对巨兽咆哮，人类向人类挥刀，人类如潮水般冲向巨兽，又被巨兽窒息、碾碎、吞噬。","id":203},{"type":"text","text":"他甚至感受到巨兽痛苦的颤抖，人类巨大的武器上弦，蓄势待发......","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"唯独目之所及，空无一物。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"无形的巨兽行过地面，草木突兀地消失，露出黄黑的泥土。","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"无形的巨构击中峰峦，山体迸裂，岩石崩塌。","id":207},{"type":"text","text":"但祂一动不动。","id":208},{"type":"text","text":"祂恐惧，祂愤怒，祂疼痛，但祂无法反击，无法躲避，甚至无法发出哀鸣。","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#6$2","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......祂的......梦魇？！","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们十二人全部离开之后，祂的那些梦境便失却了可见的形象......","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":214},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_naturaldisaster","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"代理人不由自主地向后退了一步，可就连山也在梦魇中震动。","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"他几乎站不稳了——","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":219},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哪怕是在梦里，也要记得看脚下啊。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"谁？！","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......你如何能到这里？","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#4$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"矩倒是想亲自来救你一命，可惜，祂那颗脑袋连自己做梦都勉勉强强，更不用说做别人的梦，这种地方还得是我来比较妥当。","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"也真是令人唏嘘，岁此刻的梦境，竟然已经残破至此......祸兮福所倚，福兮祸所伏。","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"你已经入了祂的梦，无论你愿与不愿，都已经以自己为笔，给祂的梦魇勾勒了一层线条。","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"看。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":236},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0","fillto":"0.2","afrom":"0","a":"1","block":"true","grad":"true","id":240},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_bg_25_g07_fairyland_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"-200","id":241},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-50","xTo":"-100","duration":"15","block":"false","id":242},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0","fillto":"0.2","afrom":"0","a":"1","block":"true","grad":"true","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"text","text":"后所指的方向，几乎不辨天地的极远处，空无之间，忽地出现了什么东西的黑色轮廓。","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gintcrturvive","id":246},{"type":"text","text":"巨兽。","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sldrchrg","volume":"0.5","channel":"1","loop":"true","id":248},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"5","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"人类。","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"武器。","id":251},{"type":"text","text":"一切仍然显得极不真实，让望想起一些炎国士兵带在身上的画册。","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"只要快速翻动，每一页上的图画就能连起来，让人觉得画上的死物在动，仿佛经了夕的点化一般。","id":253},{"type":"dialog","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"curtain","id":257},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_bg_25_g07_fairyland_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我会惊醒祂？","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"恰恰相反。","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"梦魇是不可能久长的。无论是谁，困在梦魇里，都只会一心想要醒来。有了这点轮廓，祂至少能多睡上一阵子。","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"那，福兮祸所伏，说的又是......？","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"后没开口，但望已经看见了。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"那些形象起初还生涩板滞，过了一会儿就渐渐顺畅起来。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"并不是有了什么别的变化，只是黑色的轮廓之内，出现了一个白色的阴影。","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"那是什么？","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"......你们十二个人，每个人都从祂的梦里带走了一些东西，到祂放余离开之后，祂的旧梦逐渐模糊，新梦则终于空无一物。","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"不过留下的东西与其说是空洞，不如说更像一面空荡荡的镜子，等着照出第一个如梦之物的相貌。","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"那个东西......或者说，那个人，已经是你了。","id":277},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#6$2","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......这是？！","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"祂的梦魇，也是为祂填补了梦中空洞的你的倒影。","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#5$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"你曾跟我说过百年前那些发生在你家人身上的怪事，如今，这些怪事合而为一......只不过，是以你的形象。","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"这东西既是祂的造物，祂的傀儡，也是祂不愿面对的......倒影的倒影。","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"该走了。","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"走？","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"不然呢？你还想杀了祂不成？","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"如果这就是空洞的形状，将其杀死，也许就能彻底击溃祂残存梦中的意识。","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#9$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"......你这后生脑子虽快，说话却叫人心惊。","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"梦境外的岁兽，你尚没有能力杀死，梦境之中的祂，你就能杀得掉了？","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"退一步讲，要是你有把握全身而退，那倒也行。","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我有把握......玉石俱焚。","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#9$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"啧，你这混小子，是完全不听人言啊。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"说不得，只好让你挂念的人来劝你了。","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"二哥？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#1$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"他要以自己的命为代价，在这梦中将岁杀死。","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#6$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"......二哥，你答应过我的事情，转眼就可以抛到脑后？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"如此良机......","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"千载......难逢——","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2131_1#3$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"后","text":"今天这事就到此为止。小姑娘，该带你这兄弟出梦了。再待下去，我们全都有危险——","id":320},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":321},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"focusparam","effect":"Grayscale","blur":"true","id":324},{"type":"char","duration":"2","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":325},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":326},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_bg_white.png","fadetime":"2","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$1","duration":"3","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"3.1","id":331},{"type":"char","duration":"2","from":"1","to":"0","block":"false","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","id":333},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_25_g08_pavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......这一回，是在这个梦中。","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我窥见了你沉睡的梦境，也看到了自己的倒影。","id":339},{"type":"dialog","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你看见了那倒影，而代价便是......在未来几百年中，为自己凭空制造了一个难以捉摸的劲敌。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":342},{"type":"subtitle","text":"重又面对此情此景，只怕是后悔难当了吧。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":343},{"type":"subtitle","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"一时不察，酿成大错。如果那时我就知道，你这面镜子照出的倒影，竟然也能离开梦境，潜入现实......我怎会轻易离开？","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......你究竟会藏身在哪？","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"无妨......我总会找到你。","id":350},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"嗯。该走了。","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"后显然不愿再在此处有片刻停留。祂手中朴素的木棍在空中堪堪一划，三个人的身影便瞬间消失......","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"可祂与令都未察觉的是，他们带走的，只是许多棋子中的一枚。","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"出梦之后，那枚棋子也会破碎，而后与令再想回到这梦中时，所站的山头，绝无可能与现在这座相同。","id":360},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"别再回来找我了。","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"不值得。","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","text":"","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"代理人周身忽然迸出浓烈的黑气，下一个瞬间，他已经飞身跳下眼前的悬崖，冲入无物之物的阵中。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hugemonster_sad","delay":"1","id":374},{"type":"text","text":"地平线处，兽形的巨大轮廓似乎被什么东西命中，发出震动山河的哀鸣。","id":375},{"type":"text","text":"黑色线条勾勒出的灰白人潮迅速吞没了巨兽的轮廓，朝着代理人涌来。","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"人潮如海潮，远时似乎只是一道细细的线，可涌到面前，才知道浪潮滔天。","id":377},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sldrchrg","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":379},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"a","fadetime":"3","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"玄甲，素袍，铁色的刀剑，惨白的弓。","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"千年前的炎国装备密密麻麻，宛如一幅未上色的工笔画，即将漫上代理人的脚边。","id":383},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"第一个甲士冲到代理人身前，带着法术残影的矛头直扑代理人咽喉，又被代理人一刀斩断。","id":386},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"来！","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"一字喝出。","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"在他面前，岁兽梦中的万千军队为之一滞......","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"而后涌向他，如同一条被那一字封冻了一个瞬间的冰河。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","id":395},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":399},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"bgeffect","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":407},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":408,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","duration":"0.5","id":409},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"这究竟是......怎么回事？","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"charslot","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2134_1#1$1","duration":"1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.4","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"5","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":416},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"力竭的秉烛人","text":"朔、朔先生......","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你是......令的秉烛人？她怎么了？","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"charslot","id":422},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":423},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hugemonsterroar","id":424},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":425},{"type":"text","text":"只是一句话的工夫，一只山岳般的巨爪便朝着朔的头顶直压下来。","id":426},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":427},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hghtweris","channel":"2","id":428},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchairwall","id":429},{"type":"text","text":"朔挥拳相迎，天地随之颤动。","id":430},{"type":"text","text":"一击不成，岁兽的注意力转向另一侧，祂来不及舔舐自己身上血如江涌的伤口，迎向了那边刚刚组装好的巨大兵器。","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2134_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"力竭的秉烛人","text":"我们......快要拦不住祂了。","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"力竭的秉烛人","text":"禁军折损过半，调来岁陵的玉门边军已经几乎全军覆没......！","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"力竭的秉烛人","text":"我们已经调集了百灶周围四座城市的全部守军，只希望至少能在祂毁灭下一座城市之前......","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#5$1","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"望现在在哪里......到底在哪里？！","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2134_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"力竭的秉烛人","text":"你现在找他又有什么用？","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"力竭的秉烛人","text":"是令在岁兽突然惊醒时将其余人护在梦中，是你协同大炎军队对抗岁兽......除了那罪人，还有谁可能惊醒岁兽？！","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#7$1","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"那......罪人......","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"大哥？","id":444},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"charslot","id":446},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":447},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_ptc","layer":"1","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","duration":"2","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","id":449},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":450},{"type":"bgeffect","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#7$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"令？！","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"令，你不该来这里！还是说，梦已经......","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_ptc","layer":"1","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#4$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"令","text":"谁料平生......狂酒客......","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_2023_ling_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"令","delay":"0.05","text":"如今......变作......","id":458},{"type":"dialog","id":459},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":460},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":461},{"type":"text","text":"令仍然闭着双眼。大梦尚未醒来。","id":462},{"type":"text","text":"只是，哪怕身在梦中，她仍然感受得到，梦中的兄弟姐妹也感受得到，祂已经近在咫尺。","id":463},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"charslot","id":465},{"type":"bgeffect","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#3$1","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"事已至此......","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#4$1","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......也唯有死而后已。","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":473},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordexsheath","id":474},{"type":"text","text":"清醒的朔抽出那柄尚未饮血的剑。","id":475},{"type":"text","text":"梦中的令将提灯斜斜指向岁兽的身躯。","id":476},{"type":"text","text":"岁兽也终于回头，面对着自己的分身——","id":477},{"type":"dialog","id":478},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":479},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":480},{"type":"charslot","id":481},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":483},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":484},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":485},{"type":"text","text":"然而，在整个战场上一切的人，一切的兽即将开始一切的厮杀之前，一个浑身血污的黑色身影出现在岁兽身后。","id":486},{"type":"dialog","id":487},{"type":"charslot","id":488},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_act23side_02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act23side/m_bat_act23side_02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":489,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","duration":"1","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":491},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"抓住你了。","id":493},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你——","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"穿越无数梦境中的梦境，现在所有的我，所有的我们，都在此处。你无处可去。","id":497},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":498},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你敢？！杀了我，你也会灰飞烟灭，你的所有家人都会灰飞烟灭——","id":500},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":501},{"type":"text","text":"望没有答话，而是用他那柄直刀的刀身，准确地贯穿了他追寻了不知多少个梦境的，自己的倒影的咽喉。","id":502},{"type":"dialog","id":503},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":505},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"40","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":506},{"type":"playsound","key":"$knifegore","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":508},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordsplitair","id":509},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":510,"style":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_steam_sw","slot":"charover","layer":"1"},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":511},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_wlfmster_04","layer":"4","id":512},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Colorinverse","keep":"true","id":513},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":514},{"type":"text","text":"无数梦境中奇诡的景象自喉部的创口喷涌而出。","id":515},{"type":"text","text":"山岳，巨兽，军阵......白色的梦在天地间蒸腾、翻滚，梦外的军队、代理人，甚至那头巨兽，都被鲜血般滚烫的白色雾气包裹。","id":516},{"type":"dialog","id":517},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":518},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Colorinverse","keep":"false","id":519},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":520},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":521},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":522},{"type":"bgeffect","id":523},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-70","duration":"0.6","id":524},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.6","id":525},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":526},{"type":"text","text":"直到那白色的身影颓然倒地，人们才看清，地上倒着两具已然失却生机的躯体。","id":527},{"type":"text","text":"一个是望，另一个是与望酷似，却连断了气都还满脸戾气的人，不知是何许人也。","id":528},{"type":"dialog","id":529},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":530},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#7$1","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"令？！","id":532,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":533},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#4$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.7","id":534},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_ptc","layer":"1","id":535},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":536},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":537},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":538},{"type":"text","text":"和那两具躯体倒地同时，令，和令梦中的弟妹们，也在同一时刻湮灭，归于虚无。","id":539},{"type":"bgeffect","id":540},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":541},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#5$1","id":542},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"令！","id":543,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":544},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hugemonster_sad","id":545},{"type":"text","text":"岁兽忽然发出哀鸣，与最后一个代理人悲怆的长啸重叠在一起。","id":546},{"type":"dialog","id":547},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":548},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":549},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_wangbreak","layer":"1","id":550},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_weiqi_heavy","id":551},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":552},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":553},{"type":"charslot","id":554},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Colorinverse","keep":"false","id":555},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":556},{"type":"bgeffect","id":557},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":558},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":559},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":560},{"type":"playmusic","volume":"0.6","id":561,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","duration":"1","id":562},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":563},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你还在试图用这样的幻景使我动摇......徒劳无功。","id":564},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"“谁料平生狂酒客，如今变作酒悲人。”","id":565},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这不是令会吟的诗。哪怕大限将至，也是如此。","id":566},{"type":"dialog","id":567},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":568},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......呵，这次又耗了多少棋子？","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":569},{"type":"subtitle","id":570},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":571},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","id":572},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......你可以自己去数。","id":573},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你也许觉得我的棋子剩余不多，可你的记忆，又有多少留存？","id":574},{"type":"dialog","id":575},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":576},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不多。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":577},{"type":"subtitle","text":"但你可能忘却了一件事情。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":578},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你真的觉得，区区十二分之一再度分裂而成的几枚碎片，足以和与整片大地同生的我争胜？","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":579},{"type":"subtitle","text":"记得吗？","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":580},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你上次的败亡，与这次别无二致。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":581},{"type":"subtitle","id":582},{"type":"dialog","id":583},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":584},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":585},{"type":"bgeffect","id":586},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":587},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":588},{"type":"image","id":589},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":590}],"characters":["矩","望","令","？？？","后","朔","力竭的秉烛人"]}